[
  {
    "id": "tls-handshake-basic",
    "proto": "tls",
    "summary": "TLS（端口 443）冒烟：完整 TCP 握手 + TLS 1.3 ClientHello → ServerHello → EncryptedExtensions → Certificate → Finished → 应用数据 + 终止（T-TLS-1）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {"ip": {"src": "10.0.0.1", "dst": "20.0.0.1"}},
        {"tcp": {"src_port": 12345, "dst_port": 443}},
        {"tls": {}},
        {"http": {}}
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "has_handshake": true,
      "negotiated": true,
      "terminates": true,
      "has_payload": true,
      "min_packets": 16,
      "fields": [
        {"packet": 1, "field": "tcp.flags", "value": "0x002"},
        {"packet": 1, "field": "tcp.dstport", "value": "443"},
        {"packet": 2, "field": "tcp.flags", "value": "0x012"},
        {"packet": 3, "field": "tcp.flags", "value": "0x010"},
        {"packet": 4, "field": "tls.handshake.type", "value": "1"},
        {"packet": 4, "field": "tls.record.content_type", "value": "22"},
        {"packet": 4, "field": "tls.handshake.extensions_alpn_str", "value": "h2,http/1.1"},
        {"packet": 5, "field": "tls.handshake.type", "value": "2"},
        {"packet": 6, "field": "tls.handshake.type", "value": "8"},
        {"packet": 6, "field": "tls.handshake.extensions_alpn_str", "value": "h2"},
        {"packet": 7, "field": "tls.handshake.type", "value": "11"},
        {"packet": 8, "field": "tls.handshake.type", "value": "15"},
        {"packet": 9, "field": "tls.handshake.type", "value": "20"},
        {"packet": 10, "field": "tls.handshake.type", "value": "20"}
      ],
      "frames": [
        {"packet": 11, "offset": 59, "hex": "47 45 54 20 2f 20 48 54 54 50 2f 31 2e 31"},
        {"packet": 12, "offset": 59, "hex": "48 54 54 50 2f 31 2e 31 20 32 30 30"}
      ],
      "notes": [
        "16 帧 = 3 握手 + 7 TLS 握手（f4 ClientHello/f5 ServerHello/f6 EncryptedExtensions/f7 Certificate/f8 CertificateVerify/f9/f10 Finished）+ 2 应用数据 + 4 挥手；链化后应用数据恒由内层 http 委托（legacy 128B 合成/17 帧/close_notify 口径已过期）",
        "f11 record 头 5B（17 03 03 + len 53=0x35），明文起点 frame offset=59：GET / HTTP/1.1；f12 明文起点同为 59：HTTP/1.1 200 OK（len 38=0x26）",
        "f4 ClientHello TLS 1.3（supported_versions 0x0304/0x0303，ciphers 0x1301/0x1302/0x1303，ALPN h2,http/1.1，record len 156=0x9c）；f5 ServerHello 0x0304；f6 EncryptedExtensions ALPN h2",
        "f7 Certificate 真 X.509 DER（certgen.go 确定性生成，默认参数 DER 466B）——各层长度自洽（record 479/handshake 475/certs 471/cert 466，落盘 tshark -V 验证）；tshark 干净解出 CN=trafficgen-test、O=TrafficGen Test Lab、SAN=example.com，无 malformed（D-TLS-2 后白名单已删）",
        "包号/字节均以落盘 pcap（tshark）校准，未手算"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "tls-sni-alpn",
    "proto": "tls",
    "summary": "SNI/ALPN 进 ClientHello 扩展：example.com + h2（T-TLS-2）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {"ip": {"src": "10.0.0.1", "dst": "20.0.0.1"}},
        {"tcp": {"src_port": 12346, "dst_port": 443}},
        {"tls": {"sni": "example.com", "alpn": ["h2", "http/1.1"]}},
        {"http": {}}
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "has_handshake": true,
      "negotiated": true,
      "terminates": true,
      "has_payload": true,
      "min_packets": 16,
      "fields": [
        {"packet": 4, "field": "tls.handshake.type", "value": "1"},
        {"packet": 4, "field": "tls.handshake.extensions_server_name", "value": "example.com"},
        {"packet": 4, "field": "tls.handshake.extensions_alpn_str", "value": "h2,http/1.1"},
        {"packet": 6, "field": "tls.handshake.extensions_alpn_str", "value": "h2"}
      ],
      "notes": [
        "sni 标量经层 config 原生通道进生成器（零新增代码）；alpn 标量同款直通",
        "包 6 EncryptedExtensions 取 alpn[0]=h2（layer_gen.go:110）"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "tls-neg-flat",
    "proto": "tls",
    "summary": "负例：顶层扁平五键判死（T-TLS-3）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {"ip": {"src": "10.0.0.1", "dst": "20.0.0.1"}},
        {"tcp": {"src_port": 12345, "dst_port": 443}},
        {"tls": {}},
        {"http": {}}
      ],
      "src_ip": "10.0.0.1"
    },
    "expect": {
      "expect_error": true,
      "error_contains": "no longer accepts flat config field src_ip"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "tls-neg-static-copy",
    "proto": "tls",
    "summary": "负例：层链静态复制拒绝 flows=2+全静态标量（T-TLS-4）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {"ip": {"src": "10.0.0.1", "dst": "20.0.0.1"}},
        {"tcp": {"src_port": 12345, "dst_port": 443}},
        {"tls": {}},
        {"http": {}}
      ]
    },
    "strategy_fc": {"type": "flows", "value": 2},
    "expect": {
      "expect_error": true,
      "error_contains": "static four-tuple"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "tls-dyn-sni-list",
    "proto": "tls",
    "summary": "业务 sni list 轮转：a.com/b.com 两流（T-TLS-5）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {"ip": {"src": "192.0.2.10", "dst": "198.51.100.20"}},
        {"tcp": {"dst_port": 443, "src_port": {"strategy": "list", "list": ["41001", "41002"]}}},
        {"tls": {"sni": {"strategy": "list", "list": ["a.com", "b.com"]}}},
        {"http": {}}
      ]
    },
    "strategy_fc": {"type": "flows", "value": 2},
    "expect": {
      "min_packets": 32,
      "fields": [
        {"packet": 4, "field": "tls.handshake.extensions_server_name", "distinct_values": ["a.com", "b.com"]}
      ],
      "notes": [
        "tcp list 端口是 static-copy 门逃逸口；41001→a.com、41002→b.com（同序号域对齐）",
        "包号以落盘 pcap 校准，不手算"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "tls-dyn-sni-pattern",
    "proto": "tls",
    "summary": "业务 sni pattern 替换：host1.com/host2.com 两流（T-TLS-6）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {"ip": {"src": "192.0.2.10", "dst": "198.51.100.20"}},
        {"tcp": {"dst_port": 443, "src_port": {"strategy": "list", "list": ["41002", "41003"]}}},
        {"tls": {"sni": {"strategy": "pattern", "pattern": "host{n}.com", "range": [1, 2]}}},
        {"http": {}}
      ]
    },
    "strategy_fc": {"type": "flows", "value": 2},
    "expect": {
      "min_packets": 32,
      "fields": [
        {"packet": 4, "field": "tls.handshake.extensions_server_name", "distinct_values": ["host1.com", "host2.com"]}
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "tls-dyn-sni-fixed",
    "proto": "tls",
    "summary": "业务 sni fixed 对照：单流恒为 a.com（T-TLS-5 对照端）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {"ip": {"src": "192.0.2.10", "dst": "198.51.100.20"}},
        {"tcp": {"src_port": 41003, "dst_port": 443}},
        {"tls": {"sni": {"strategy": "fixed", "value": "a.com"}}},
        {"http": {}}
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "min_packets": 16,
      "fields": [
        {"packet": 4, "field": "tls.handshake.extensions_server_name", "value": "a.com"}
      ],
      "notes": [
        "fixed 是动态形状的退化对照端：对象写法、标量效果；单流 fixed 不触发 static-copy 门"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "tls-neg-dyn-closed-version",
    "proto": "tls",
    "summary": "负例：关闭字段 version/alpn/role 动态被拒（T-TLS-8）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {"ip": {"src": "192.0.2.10", "dst": "198.51.100.20"}},
        {"tcp": {"src_port": 41001, "dst_port": 443}},
        {"tls": {"version": {"strategy": "list", "list": ["tls1.3", "tls1.2"]}}},
        {"http": {}}
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "expect_error": true,
      "error_contains": "does not support dynamic"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "tls-http-inner",
    "proto": "tls",
    "summary": "https 套娃：内层 http GET /tls-inner 包进 ApplicationData（T-TLS-9）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {"ip": {"src": "10.0.0.1", "dst": "20.0.0.1"}},
        {"tcp": {"src_port": 40000, "dst_port": 443}},
        {"tls": {}},
        {"http": {"method": "GET", "uri": "/tls-inner", "version": "1.1"}}
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "has_handshake": true,
      "terminates": true,
      "has_payload": true,
      "min_packets": 16,
      "fields": [
        {"packet": 4, "field": "tls.handshake.type", "value": "1"}
      ],
      "frames": [
        {"packet": 11, "offset": 59, "hex": "47 45 54 20 2f 74 6c 73 2d 69 6e 6e 65 72"}
      ],
      "notes": [
        "内层 http 请求字节经 tls 包成 ApplicationData record（content_type=23）；record 头 5B（17 03 03 + len），明文起点 offset=59",
        "GET /tls-inner 明文 hex：47 45 54 20 2f 74 6c 73 2d 69 6e 6e 65 72；包号以落盘 pcap 校准"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "tls-cert-static",
    "proto": "tls",
    "summary": "cert 静态全填：自定义 DN/SAN/有效期进 Certificate（T-TLS-10）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {"ip": {"src": "10.0.0.1", "dst": "20.0.0.1"}},
        {"tcp": {"src_port": 12347, "dst_port": 443}},
        {"tls": {"cert": {"subject": "CN=api.test.local,O=TestOrg,OU=QA,L=Beijing,ST=Beijing,C=CN", "san": ["api.test.local", "www.test.local"], "key_type": "ecdsa-p256", "not_before": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "not_after": "2036-01-01T00:00:00Z"}}},
        {"http": {}}
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "has_handshake": true,
      "negotiated": true,
      "terminates": true,
      "has_payload": true,
      "min_packets": 16,
      "fields": [
        {"packet": 7, "field": "tls.handshake.type", "value": "11"},
        {"packet": 7, "field": "x509ce.dNSName", "value": "api.test.local,www.test.local"}
      ],
      "notes": [
        "f7 Certificate 帧真 X.509 DER（certgen.go 确定性生成），tshark 干净解出无 malformed；CN/O/SAN/有效期全是用户配置明文上 wire",
        "包号以落盘 pcap 校准，不手算"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "tls-cert-dyn-subject",
    "proto": "tls",
    "summary": "cert.subject list 轮转：两流 CN 分别 a.test/b.test（T-TLS-12）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {"ip": {"src": "192.0.2.10", "dst": "198.51.100.20"}},
        {"tcp": {"dst_port": 443, "src_port": {"strategy": "list", "list": ["41011", "41012"]}}},
        {"tls": {"cert": {"subject": {"strategy": "list", "list": ["CN=a.test,O=TrafficGen Test Lab,C=CN", "CN=b.test,O=TrafficGen Test Lab,C=CN"]}}}},
        {"http": {}}
      ]
    },
    "strategy_fc": {"type": "flows", "value": 2},
    "expect": {
      "min_packets": 32,
      "fields": [
        {"packet": 7, "field": "x509sat.printableString", "distinct_values": ["TrafficGen Test Lab,a.test,TrafficGen Test Lab,a.test", "TrafficGen Test Lab,b.test,TrafficGen Test Lab,b.test"]}
      ],
      "notes": [
        "subject 整 DN 串替换语义（F1 决策）；41011→a.test（f7）、41012→b.test（f23）（同序号域对齐）；CN 经 x509sat.printableString 聚合（含 O 值，tshark 该字段无独立 CN 项）",
        "包号以落盘 pcap 校准，不手算"
      ]
    }
  },
